
== §1 — SPEC INTEGRITY AND NO-DRIFT ==
  ✓ browser spec is byte-identical to acs_visual.json
  ✓ schema and compiler version are pinned
  ✓ all nine visual modes are declared
  ✓ every material is classified VISUAL_MATERIAL and nothing else
  ✓ no material in the library carries an engineering property
  ✓ material provenance separates SYSTEM_DEFAULT from USER
  ✓ the spec forbids treating a render as measured or as-built
  ✓ the spec names no code, standard or authority
  ✓ the AI may not change any layout feature

== §2 — NO ENGINEERING GEOMETRY MUTATION ==
  ✓ compiling a scene mutates no source model
  ✓ every visual mode leaves the model untouched
  ✓ every discipline model is byte-identical after visualisation
